.idea
.vscode
**/__pycache__/*
**/node_modules

# Raw asciinema casts exceed GitHub's 100 MiB blob limit; commit the .gz instead.
# Replay: gunzip -c evsc-agent-run.cast.gz > /tmp/run.cast && asciinema play /tmp/run.cast
*.cast

# Talk scripts stay local-only: they are delivery notes, not artefacts anyone
# else should read or diff. Untracked with `git rm --cached`, still on disk.
talk.md
talk.docx
talk-v3.md
demo-script.md
~$*

# Talk authoring tooling (markdown -> docx renderer and its Word style donor).
# Local-only for the same reason as the scripts above. Leading slash keeps this
# to the repo root -- evsc-agent-run/scripts/ is tracked and must stay tracked.
/scripts/
